          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "In scope: group parent last-child death foreclosure \u2014 parent close, force-bill visibility for parent and child, Summary Accrued vs Original, Overview excess=0, last-child amount equals principal with excess=0, dirty pre-existing EMI billing row, same-day multi-child force-bill uniqueness."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Unchanged: non-last child path still allows payment-row amount to differ from principal while transaction amounts match (product decision pending \u2014 see Notes)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Edge: \u20b91 future-schedule interest parent vs remaining member remains open for product decision (fix vs tolerance). Parent residual interest stays Out-of-scope for this ticket."
